  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>ELDEN RING BIRD FARM FOR MOHGWYNS PALACE

Step 1. Navigate to Mohgwyns palace "Palace Approached Ledge Road"
Step 2. Have a bow with max arrows and 2 hand it 
Step 3. run the macro 

Notes: if it does not work try these settings
Default settings 
2400 DPI
1920x1080 resolution
if it does not work you can make your own using the record button on the same page you are uploading the file 

How to do that:
Step 1. Right click the Added folder and add new Document 
Step 2. In the top right there will be a record button press that and open your game (make sure precise mouse movement its on)
Step 3. record your macro and implement it using the security page

You should be able to play the macro using your hotkey set up 

Have fun bird farming! </Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
